        <mxCell id="9pI-jRh9yoKnxfV0BXcw-202" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Organisation of Human Energy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The entity* which most effectively organises human energy (and energy in general) for the purpose of increasing it&#39;s rate of organisation will dominate. Potentially an entity could reach a state of perfection from which no other process could surpass it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;If this were a collective entity concerned with the wellbeing of all constituents then this would trend towards a utopia. Private power could lead towards a dystopia or triggering of a natural process i.e. climate change that will re-organise/stunt humanity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*This could include any iterative process, be it physical laws, human society or code-based.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="234" width="367" x="8216" y="273" as="geometry" />
